      Security Metrics Dashboard (metrics-dash-01) tracking security KPIs
        Failed Authentication Attempts Counter (auth_fail_count) - Last 24hr rolling window
        Number of Active Security Incidents (incident_count) - Current open cases
        Mean Time to Detect (MTTD) Metric - Average detection time in minutes
        System Patch Compliance Rate (patch_compliance) - Percentage of systems up-to-date
        Cloud Resource Misconfigurations (config_issues) - Count of detected issues
        Data Loss Prevention Events (dlp_events) - Daily event count
        Identity Access Management Changes (iam_changes) - Hourly modification rate
        Endpoint Protection Status (endpoint_health) - Percentage of healthy endpoints
