        Privileged Account Usage (privileged_access) - Suspicious activity tracking
        Data Classification Compliance (data_classification) - Sensitive data tracking
        Security Alert Response Time (alert_response) - Average time in minutes
        Password Policy Violations (password_violations) - Daily violation count
        Backup Success Rate (backup_status) - Last 24hr completion rate
        Security Training Compliance (training_status) - Employee completion rate
        Third-party Access Risk Score (vendor_risk) - Vendor security rating
        Container Security Status (container_health) - Container vulnerability score
        Cloud Workload Protection Coverage (workload_protection) - Protection percentage
        DNS Security Events (dns_security) - Malicious domain request count
        SSL/TLS Certificate Health (cert_status) - Expiration and compliance tracking
        Security Automation Coverage (automation_coverage) - Percentage of automated responses
        Cloud Cost Security Anomalies (cost_anomalies) - Unusual spending patterns
        Geographic Access Distribution (geo_access) - Access location heat map
        Resource Tagging Compliance (tag_compliance) - Resource labeling status
        Security Policy Exceptions (policy_exceptions) - Active exception count
        Cross-Account Activity (cross_account) - Suspicious cross-account access
        Cloud Service Availability SLA (service_sla) - Uptime percentage tracking
        GDPR Compliance Score (gdpr_compliance) - Regulatory compliance percentage
        Zero Trust Security Status (zero_trust) - Policy enforcement rate
        DevSecOps Pipeline Security (devsecops_security) - Build/deployment security score
        Cloud Asset Inventory Health (asset_inventory) - Asset discovery accuracy
        Malware Detection Events (malware_events) - Detection count and severity
        Data Sovereignty Compliance (data_sovereignty) - Cross-border data flow tracking
        Identity Governance Score (identity_governance) - Access review status
        Cloud Network Segmentation (network_segmentation) - Isolation compliance score
