    Blockchain Services - Distributed ledger and smart contract platforms
      Public Blockchain Networks - Decentralized networks like Ethereum, Bitcoin that are open for anyone to participate
        Ethereum Mainnet (ChainID: 1) - Proof of Stake consensus network with smart contract capability
        Bitcoin Network (Magic: 0xD9B4BEF9) - Proof of Work consensus network with UTXO model
        BNB Smart Chain (ChainID: 56) - Proof of Staked Authority consensus with EVM compatibility
        Polygon PoS Chain (ChainID: 137) - Proof of Stake sidechain with EVM compatibility
        Solana Mainnet (ChainID: 101) - Proof of History/Proof of Stake hybrid consensus
        Avalanche C-Chain (ChainID: 43114) - Proof of Stake consensus with EVM compatibility
        Cardano Mainnet (Network Magic: 764824073) - Ouroboros Proof of Stake consensus
        Polkadot Relay Chain (Network ID: 0) - Nominated Proof of Stake consensus
        Cosmos Hub (Chain-ID: cosmoshub-4) - Tendermint BFT consensus mechanism
        TRON Mainnet (ChainID: 728126428) - Delegated Proof of Stake consensus
        Monero Network (NetworkID: 18) - Privacy-focused CryptoNote protocol with RandomX PoW
        Algorand Mainnet (NetworkID: mainnet-v1.0) - Pure Proof of Stake consensus
        XRP Ledger (NetworkID: main) - Federated consensus protocol
        Litecoin Network (Magic: 0xDCB7C1FC) - Scrypt-based Proof of Work consensus
        Stellar Network (Network Passphrase: Public Global Stellar Network) - Stellar Consensus Protocol
        Near Protocol Mainnet (ChainID: mainnet) - Thresholded Proof of Stake consensus
        Fantom Opera Mainnet (ChainID: 250) - Proof of Stake with Lachesis consensus
        Hedera Mainnet (Network: mainnet) - Hashgraph consensus mechanism
        Tezos Mainnet (ChainID: NetXdQprcVkpaWU) - Liquid Proof of Stake consensus
        Zcash Mainnet (Magic: 0x6427E924) - Privacy-focused Equihash PoW consensus
        Flow Mainnet (ChainID: flow-mainnet) - Multi-role architecture with HotStuff consensus
        Harmony Mainnet (ChainID: 1666600000) - Effective Proof of Stake with sharding
        Waves Mainnet (ChainID: W) - Leased Proof of Stake consensus
        VeChain Thor Mainnet (ChainID: 100) - Proof of Authority consensus
        Elrond Mainnet (ChainID: 1) - Adaptive State Sharding with SPoS
        IOTA Mainnet (Network: mainnet) - Directed Acyclic Graph with Coordicide
        Kusama Network (NetworkID: 2) - Polkadot's canary network with NPoS
        Cronos Mainnet (ChainID: 25) - Proof of Authority with Tendermint consensus
        ThunderCore Mainnet (ChainID: 108) - PaLa consensus mechanism
        IoTeX Network (ChainID: 4689) - Roll-DPoS consensus mechanism
