        Starknet Mainnet (ChainID: SN_MAIN) - ZK rollup L2 for Ethereum
        Kadena Network (ChainID: 0) - Proof of Work with Chainweb protocol
        Mina Protocol (ChainID: mina) - Succinct blockchain with zk-SNARKs
        Loopring (ChainID: 1) - ZK rollup L2 for Ethereum
        zkSync Era Mainnet (ChainID: 324) - ZK rollup L2 with zkEVM
