    OT-IT Interface Systems: Systems bridging operational and information technology
      Data Diodes: Unidirectional security gateways ensuring one-way data flow between OT and IT networks
        DD-North-01: Waterfall Security Solutions data diode (Plant Floor to DMZ, IP: 192.168.1.10)
        DD-South-02: Fox-IT DataDiode (Production Network to Corporate, IP: 192.168.2.20)
        DD-East-03: Owl Cyber Defense OPDS-100 (SCADA to Historian, IP: 192.168.3.30)
        DD-West-04: Genua genugate (Control System to Business Network, IP: 192.168.4.40)
        DD-Central-05: Siemens SIMATIC NET Data Diode (DCS to Enterprise, IP: 192.168.5.50)
        DD-Power-06: BAE Systems DataDiode (Power Grid Control to Operations Center, IP: 192.168.6.60)
        DD-Backup-07: Owl Cyber Defense OPDS-1000 Redundant Unit (Primary Control Room to Backup Site, IP: 192.168.7.70)
        DD-Patch-08: Advenica SecuriCDS (Patch Management Server to OT Network, IP: 192.168.8.80)
        DD-Files-09: Fox-IT DataDiode File Transfer System (Engineering Workstations to Corporate Network, IP: 192.168.9.90)
        DD-Water-10: Waterfall Unidirectional Security Gateway (Water Treatment SCADA to Cloud Monitoring, IP: 192.168.10.100)
        DD-Chem-11: Owl Cyber Defense OPDS-5D (Chemical Plant Safety System to Monitoring Network, IP: 192.168.11.110)
        DD-Remote-12: Waterfall Unidirectional Gateway (Remote Oil Platform to Control Center, IP: 192.168.12.120)
        DD-Logs-13: Genua genugate Logger (OT Security Logs to SIEM System, IP: 192.168.13.130)
        DD-Compliance-14: Siemens SIMATIC NET DD-NERC (NERC CIP Compliant Power Station to Corporate, IP: 192.168.14.140)
        DD-Safety-15: BAE Systems DD-SIS (Safety Instrumented System to Process Control Network, IP: 192.168.15.150)
      Industrial DMZ Servers: Intermediary servers in demilitarized zones managing OT-IT data exchange
        DMZ-HIST01 (10.100.1.10): Primary historian server collecting process data from Plant 1
        DMZ-CONV02 (10.100.1.11): Protocol gateway converting Modbus to OPC UA
        DMZ-DIODE1 (10.100.1.12): Unidirectional security gateway for Plant 1 data transfer
        DMZ-ACCESS01 (10.100.1.13): Access control server managing IT-OT authentication
        DMZ-BACKUP1 (10.100.1.14): Backup historian server for redundancy
        DMZ-PROXY01 (10.100.1.15): Industrial protocol proxy server for OT network isolation
