    AI Feedback System: Infrastructure collecting and processing model feedback
      FeedbackCollector-01 (IP: 192.168.1.100): Primary feedback ingestion server for user interactions
        PostgreSQL Database Instance "fb_store_main" (Port 5432): Primary feedback storage database
        REST API Endpoint "/api/v1/feedback" (Port 8080): Main feedback ingestion interface
        Authentication Service "fb_auth" (Port 8443): OAuth2-based user authentication service
        Redis Cache Instance "fb_cache_01" (Port 6379): Temporary feedback data cache
        Monitoring Agent "prometheus_exporter" (Port 9090): Metrics collection service
        Message Queue "rabbitmq_feedback" (Port 5672): Feedback processing queue
        Log Aggregator Service "filebeat_collector" (Port 5044): Feedback system logging
        Admin Web Interface "fb_admin" (Port 443): Administrative control panel
        Backup Service "fb_backup" (Port 22): Automated feedback data backup system
        Health Check Endpoint "/health" (Port 8081): System status monitoring interface
        Data Validation Service "fb_validator" (Port 8082): Input sanitization and verification service
        ETL Pipeline "fb_etl_processor" (Port 8083): Data transformation service
        Rate Limiting Service "fb_throttle" (Port 8084): Request throttling mechanism
        Integration Gateway "fb_gateway" (Port 8085): External systems connector
        Model Performance Metrics Service "fb_metrics" (Port 8086): AI model feedback analytics
        Feedback Classification Service "fb_classifier" (Port 8087): Automated feedback categorization
        Notification Service "fb_notifier" (Port 8088): Alert and notification dispatcher
        Data Encryption Service "fb_crypto" (Port 8089): Data encryption/decryption service
        Session Management Service "fb_session" (Port 8090): User session handler
        API Documentation Server "fb_swagger" (Port 8091): Interactive API documentation
        Load Balancer "fb_balancer" (Port 8092): Traffic distribution service
        Data Masking Service "fb_anonymizer" (Port 8093): PII anonymization processor
        Compliance Logger "fb_compliance" (Port 8094): Regulatory compliance tracking
        Model Bias Detection "fb_bias_detector" (Port 8095): Feedback bias analysis service
        Data Quality Monitor "fb_quality" (Port 8096): Data quality assessment service
        Feedback Correlation Engine "fb_correlator" (Port 8097): Cross-reference analysis service
        Emergency Shutdown Service "fb_shutdown" (Port 8098): Graceful system termination
        Configuration Manager "fb_config" (Port 8099): Dynamic configuration service
        Feedback Prioritization Service "fb_priority" (Port 8100): Critical feedback identification
        System Recovery Service "fb_recovery" (Port 8101): Automated recovery orchestration
      FeedbackDB-Master (IP: 192.168.1.101): Main PostgreSQL database storing structured feedback data
        user_feedback_table: Contains raw user interactions and feedback submissions
        model_performance_metrics: Stores accuracy, precision, recall metrics per model version
        training_data_corrections: Holds user-submitted corrections to model outputs
        system_audit_logs: Database audit trail of all feedback processing operations
        access_control_table: User permissions and role assignments for feedback system
        model_version_metadata: Links between model versions and associated feedback
        feedback_classification_rules: Business logic for categorizing incoming feedback
        data_quality_scores: Metrics about feedback data reliability and usefulness
        feedback_queue_status: Current processing state of feedback items
        sensitive_feedback_archive: Historical feedback data marked as sensitive
        feedback_aggregation_views: Materialized views for reporting and analytics
        external_system_mappings: Configuration for data integration with other AI systems
        feedback_validation_rules: Data validation and business rule definitions
        user_session_tracking: User interaction session data and metadata
        feedback_categorization_taxonomy: Hierarchical classification structure
        backup_metadata_log: Tracking information for database backups
        data_retention_policies: Configuration for data lifecycle management
        error_feedback_correlation: Links between reported errors and feedback
        geographic_distribution_stats: Regional feedback distribution data
        compliance_audit_records: Regulatory compliance tracking data
        model_feedback_dependencies: Cross-references between interdependent AI models
        feedback_processing_metrics: Performance stats of feedback processing pipeline
        language_specific_feedback: Segregated feedback data by language/locale
        feedback_sentiment_analysis: Processed sentiment scores and classifications
